@page "/"

<PageTitle>Genetic Algorithm Bench</PageTitle>

<h1>Genetic Algorithm Bench</h1>

<p class="lead">
    A small workbench for exploring genetic algorithms: pick a problem, choose the operators,
    tune the parameters, and watch the loss curve evolve generation by generation.
</p>

<div class="row g-3 mt-2">
    <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="card h-100">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h5 class="card-title">Builder</h5>
                <p class="card-text">
                    Configure a problem, its operators and their parameters, then run it and
                    inspect the live loss chart. Save the result when you like what you see.
                </p>
                <a class="btn btn-primary" href="builder">Open the Builder</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="card h-100">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h5 class="card-title">History</h5>
                <p class="card-text">
                    Browse the experiments you saved, compare their best-loss curves side by
                    side, and delete the ones you no longer need.
                </p>
                <a class="btn btn-outline-primary" href="history">Open the History</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
